Can't configure or persist scheduled jobs with nominal values

Our scheduling service uses `@horizon-republic/nominal-types` for configuration and scheduled records. I need to read settings from text and carry validated values through JSON and database storage without losing their nominal types. Different deployments use Drizzle, MikroORM, Sequelize or TypeORM.

```ts
import 'temporal-polyfill/global';
import { n, Port } from '@horizon-republic/nominal-types';
import { Instant } from '@horizon-republic/nominal-types/temporal';
const port = n.of(Port).fromString().parse('6123');
const runAt = new Instant('2031-07-18T14:15:00+03:00');
const payload = JSON.stringify({ runAt });
```

I expect settings to become checked values, schedule values to serialize and compare correctly, and database fields to return nominal instances. Currently the unfinished routines throw `new Error("not implemented")`, blocking these flows.

The unfinished files are:

- In `src/core/`: `type-schema.ts`, `text-form.ts`, `nominal.ts`, `same-value.ts`, `same-type.ts` and `messages.ts`.
- In `src/temporal/`: `instant.ts`, `plain-date.ts`, `plain-time.ts`, `plain-date-time.ts`, `zoned-date-time.ts`, `duration.ts`, `time-zone-id.ts`, `grammar.ts` and `temporal-rule.ts`.
- In `src/adapters/`: `drizzle/to-drizzle.ts`, `mikro-orm/to-mikro-orm.ts`, `sequelize/to-sequelize.ts`, `typeorm/to-typeorm.ts`, `orm/column.ts`, `orm/values.ts` and `type-json.ts`.

